{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a109ca49-303d-81f0-b779-481ed50512fc",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T14:24:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colleen Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, thank you for taking my call. I'm calling about a manhole cover on my street that has sunk down in the road. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Where is it? What street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of 328 Admiral Kalbfus Road, in the North End. Sorry, can you hear me all right? I'm on my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're a little choppy but I got the address. 328 Admiral Kalbfus. Tell me about the manhole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. The cover has sunk below the pavement, and every time a car crosses it, it rings. [line breaks up] a loud clank, every single time. Thank you for listening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up there. It clanks when cars go over it, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Clanks, and rings a bit after. Thank you for checking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Is it in the travel lane, or off to the side by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in the travel lane, I'd say toward the middle of our side. And, um, this is on a bus route, so the buses go over it too. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's helpful to know, the bus route. Does it look like the cover itself is cracked or loose, or just sitting low?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just sitting low, I believe. The road around it has dipped. [inaudible] I don't think it's cracked, but I can't say for certain. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll put in a request for a crew to go out and look at it. They'll check the cover and the pavement around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. I can hear it from my living room, honestly. I left a half-finished sweater on the couch and it rings right over it. Sorry, that's not important. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's okay. Do you want a call back at a number, or just the request on file?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call back would be lovely. It's 401-555-0169. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0169. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Could I please have a reference number for the request? Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hang on a second. [pause] Okay, your request number is PW-4471-J. Want me to repeat that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please, I'm sorry, the line cut out on the last part. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P as in Paul, W as in William, dash four four seven one, dash J as in John."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P W, four four seven one, J. Thank you so much, I have it written down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. A crew will get out there when they can. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you for your help, Denise. Have a good afternoon. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
